{
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "这里像撤景后的仓库。道具堆得到处都是……我认得几套，是我穿过的。",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "列位诸公，别见怪，都是撤景落下的。喏，那把斧子——潘凤用过的，跟华雄打了几个回合才落地。你挑件顺手的吧。",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "龙套啊，你又来了。上次你还是门卫，这次通告单上写成关二爷了——眼皮一眨，老母鸡变鸭！",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "我翻了半天，也没找着能证明「你就是你」的道具。这么几个龙套要演几百个角色，谁记得谁是谁。",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……要是真有那种东西，也不会摆在仓库门口。龙套用的都在角落里，跟主子爷身边的奴才一样，没人记得。",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "说得在理。拿着走吧。下一场要是演砸被场务叉出去——至少道具还在你手上。",

  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "没有布景，没有镜头……空景里有个旁白在念：「三国再次归于一统……」——等等，什么叫「再次」？",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[sine]...那是天意爷..... \n...导演进去了..... \n...编剧也进去了..... \n...只剩旁白..... \n...还在念..... \n...历史发生了剧变.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...你又开机了..... \n...这一遍..... \n...和上一遍对不上..... \n...像修正版配音..... \n...变声期.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[sine]...你还缺什么..... \n...台词？分镜？..... \n...还是结局？.....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "祈求",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "若你一定要把我写进剧本……请让我分得清，哪些记忆属于演员，哪些属于角色。",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[sine]...塔顶有人写结局..... \n...去吧..... \n...别信旁白..... \n...它只管巨变..... \n...不管演员.....[/sine]",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "满墙的脸谱……我演过的每一张，好像都被你收在这儿了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "说出吾名，吓汝一跳！……逗你的，我是化妆师。来，拾掇成今天最像主角的样子。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "《新三国》里将军号都是批发的，但脸可得挑一张撑得住的——你今天带哪张？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "龙套啊，告诉我你「真实」的面貌？世人今天看错了你，明天可能还会看错。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "婉拒",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……我没有自己的脸。有的只是一堆借来的五官——整部戏说不定都是孙乾演的，换张皮而已。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "那就挑几张借来的带走。下一幕它们还会抢着替你说话——我子敬真的是要醉啦，这妆化得我眼花。",

  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "通告单又改了……上一页我还是传令兵，这一页写成太监，再下一页要我去给丞相养马倒尿壶。",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "龙套啊，上一秒你是上将军，下一秒你是小公公——这就是天意！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "——那好啊，他过江我也过江，天意要把我也塞进轮回，我就给他点小惊喜！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "给你个东西！！想不想抓住「剧本还没翻页」的那一秒？！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……我只想要一条不会自己改写的剧本。",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "没有那种东西！！但乱也有乱的好处——总有一天你能找到跳出轮回的方法！！",

  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "场记还没喊「CUT」，导演已经拍下一条了……龙套躺下，生死不明。",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]生死不明？那就是死了……在剧组里，没戏拍跟死了没区别……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]醒着的人背台词……躺着的人等场记……演尸体演得越多，自刎术就越高明……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]所以……你都爬了一辈子塔了，就不能享受享受吗……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回答",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "他们都有名字、下场、至少是墓碑……但龙套必须不停地演……",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]也是……拿着这个走吧……下一场开拍前……还能享受一下凉爽的夏夜……[/thinky_dots]",

  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "武戏没排练就要上……通告单只写了「开打」，连对手是谁都没标。",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "[b]别废话！！我的大斧早就饥渴难耐了！！!你！拿着兵器赶紧过来！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[b]主演呢？！那个拿天价片酬的怎么还不来？！别老让龙套扛武戏！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "[b]天意要全民覆甲！！要镜头乱切！！它不要演技！！那就演给它看！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "退让",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……我明明没练过武。可身体记得怎么挥刀……。",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "[b]好！！那就往上打！！打到塔顶！！捅他一万个透明窟窿！！！[/b]",

  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "火堆倒是暖和……可剧组收工了，陈留大食堂都关门了，连盒饭都没留下。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "龙套啊，没饭吃不要紧。来，先喝口[jitter][b]热酒[/b][/jitter]——当浮一大白！吃什么？有酒就行。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你背上那堆，不是行李吧？是还没卸下来的剧本。要不要在这儿先放下一张脸？我正渴着哪，陪你坐会儿。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "趁热来一口。鲜美无比，不可不尝——要带走吗？不可在半道上凉了。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "推辞",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "……不用了。龙套饿一点反而正常——没人记得有没有给你发过饭。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "那就在火边坐会儿。……等火灭了，再星夜赶路。",

  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "你也做生意？那你要换走什么……名字，记忆，还是「龙套演员」这四个字？",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "最便宜的，是你以为还属于自己的那点[sine]自我[/sine]。你知道的，我这个人做买卖一向实在——卑鄙是卑鄙者的通行证，合同里写得明白。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "我见过很多卖灵魂的人，你倒是心有灵犀。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "合同末尾有一行小字：「乙方同意永久扮演他人指定之角色」。签吗？",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "随便什么……反正一切都是天意。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2.ancient": "好志气！！但愿你分得清，哪一笔账该由哪一个「你」来付。",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "你的通告单可没让你来这里。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "通什么？告什么？没听说过！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "这塔顶到底你是主，还是我是主？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又来了。你要补拍，还是再演一轮？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "建贼！奸贼！恶贼！逆~ 贼！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "不要愤怒，愤怒会降低你的智慧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.1-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "被侵蚀成这样，还能走到这里吗…",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "龙套把角色全演完后……\n[i][font_size=22]剩下的，会是我自己吗？？[/font_size][/i]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_UNIVERSE_CHARACTER_SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "龙套？龙，可是帝王之征啊……",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SUNQIAN_CHARACTER.2-attack": "Both"
}
